<title>JAPAN: Shiseido to start sales in Vietnam in September.</title>
<headline>Shiseido to start sales in Vietnam in September.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shiseido Co Ltd said on Friday it would start selling cosmetics in Vietnam through a local importing company from September.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that it was one of the first global cosmetics manufacturers to officially export its products to Vietnam.</p>
<p>Shiseido said it signed a sales contract with Scitechimex Co, an importing company which is based in Ho Chi Minh City, in Tokyo on Friday.</p>
</text>
